## ==========================================
## Critical Build Outputs & Binaries
## ==========================================
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
**/publish/
**/PublishOutput/

# Force ignore compiled binaries and native artifacts
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.pfx
*.iso

## ==========================================
## User-Specific Settings & IDE Caches
## ==========================================
.vs/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.suo
*.sln.docstates
*.env

## ==========================================
## VS Code (Blocks workspace cache & user state)
## ==========================================
.vscode/
.history/
*.vsix

## ==========================================
## Visual Studio Logs & Temporary Files
## ==========================================
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
*.log
*.tlog
*.binlog
MSBuild_Logs/

## ==========================================
## NuGet & Package Caches
## ==========================================
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.lock.json

